<description>&lt;p&gt;Venezuela is reeling from deadly earthquakes that have killed thousands and triggered a humanitarian response, while President Nicolás Maduro and his wife have pleaded not guilty to U.S. torture conspiracy charges and face a trial delayed until 2027. The United States has lifted sanctions on the leader of Venezuela's National Assembly and has deployed Space Force electromagnetic and electronic warfare systems against Venezuela, mirroring actions taken in Iran. Chile has sentenced a Venezuelan gang member to 20 years for kidnapping and killing a dissident. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxOQkxsMHduY2c2LV96MVRpOXo2UHhHUXdLYWhEc2p4ZGYycnE5eF9wdGc5T19iV25lNW4zOS1DenpkeXo3aHZZdmMtVzlyNjN1LTdQSmUxcllFTUpCMzN3QWtaSEs2SDJsbFNOMGhEOExvejdPdVpVcFhTTjR6NUZzLWhxQnc2UFVQLUhRbDFJc0Z0LV9Gcl9HQnVYYjlOVklqdW5QR0RjOEFaVnhaaGZWNHg1TDZKUkZHNm5Z?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPMTlvMlFLS3dOcXlXRmV3eFdaeVFlZlJ5V0xoZkFiRGw3Zm1LX3FTa3RrWUhOWlk0SzRUUzNJeGVuMVVrTkt2bzR1ZWp3by1Bb1NybkhGbUhaRmpwWTRLVU5ENnl6OFdxM0Y2YnFvV3JXb1NuY09TUHl3S0pISzh0em1aR0s?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTFBIVnNUd0hRZVJmeEJqYzNZWDVGT0NuSmY2N2lFTTF6Nk5Lc2VOM3NlOHo1RjRDWmJKRGxpQnJhRk1SZXNibWtlVjJQNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPSThkVlA4a1BiZmExS0k4djM2cmEwaXliX2k5eUFnLU9qM2x6X0llMkU5QjhiNWxZLVI0SzF6Ykc5aEVVTTFydjF4MzgtVHJPRU10V2tFM0prSWRDVWJiU2pUaFNlLWo0eGd3dmtwNjFZYk1HLUVreW1rMzhKUDZ2Wm9FNzFFVnZGVE51REU1aWY?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxPSm53RDlpSVFXRjkzV1pJTkIyYlRze